Assumed that block size is one that is at each cache line single mem address and val will be stored and also in case read always assign val 1 at that mem location 
And output format is like if there is cache miss then it will show Just Cache miss 
And if there is cache hit then it will show cache hit and val at that address  
If at same mem location new val is to write considered as cache hit and update val directly in cache

Sample Example

Input format be as follows 
Operation MEM_address Val(if needed)
1.Read 2.Write 3.Exit
1 12
Cache miss
1 2
Cache miss
2 24 4
Cache miss
1 0
Cache miss
1 0
Cache hit : 1   ; here default val if read done before write
1 11
Need eviction
1 11
Cache hit : 1
1 12 
Cache hit : 1
2 13 23
Cache miss
1 13 
Cache hit : 23  ; here updated val 
3 ; to exit/terminate

